s and one ledger interface. Its capability maturity is 2 STABLE, 9 EXPERIMENTAL and 1 INTERFACE_ONLY. The v0.2 additive source-use table below records the new integrations separately.\n \n Modes describe a source relationship. A concrete implementation slice, adapter test result and full host validation are separate facts. `provenance/sources.json` records each capability and its exact product-file mapping. Unused optional sources remain visible; no full capability is inferred from using one function in the same repository.\n \n-## All 20 owned repositories\n+## v0.1 accounted 20 owned repositories\n \n-| Repository | Mode | Audit snapshot | Fresh default | Current default grant | Concrete product files / status | Account |\n+| Repository | Mode | Audit snapshot | v0.1 observed default | v0.1 observed grant | Concrete product files / status | Account |\n | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n | pipavlo82/-crystal-artifact | optional_interface | `fc0cd2cbe96ec448ac244ae21daabdab68c17022` | `fc0cd2cbe96ec448ac244ae21daabdab68c17022` | ABSENT_NO_ROOT_GRANT | No capability implementation selected; accounted source not implemented | Paper/QR transport and viewer ideas remain useful. The current product keeps native evidence behind adapters and does not copy the vendored QR implementation or historical rendered artifacts. |\n | pipavlo82/Chronicle | adapter | `c467b48fd18fc8ec86f10582befa35946ce41914` | `c467b48fd18fc8ec86f10582befa35946ce41914` | Apache-2.0 | `src/adapters/chronicle.mjs`, `tests/relations.test.mjs`; declared bounded slices and methods applied | Supplied entry identity, exact reference strings and historical/current query boundaries inform the continuity adapter. Collection/portfolio aggregate-root construction and verification remain unimplemented. User histories and the Chronicle brand are not imported. |\n@@ -31,9 +31,9 @@ Modes describe a source relationship. A concrete implementation slice, adapter t\n | pipavlo82/relational-security-invariants | methodology | `e8fb81904af2ffe19e974383cf78d9d18d259b98` | `3d3038f90c3dd98e79f948398167c5cc3ef2fdd8` | Apache-2.0 for Pavlo-authored scope; preserved third-party terms in LICENSING.md | `tools/run-mutations.mjs`, `tools/run-vectors.mjs`; declared bounded slices and methods applied | Independent expected relations, protected maintenance and load-bearing source controls inform assurance. The new scoped Apache grant does not relicense evidence copies or prove evaluator independence. |\n | pipavlo82/semantic-execution-guard | optional_interface | `777a19f5e92afb60b123c545f0e9a3d77fe7e139` | `18f595b537017e5ff7b9074366c3065e877488f9` | Apache-2.0 for Pavlo-authored scope; preserved third-party terms in LICENSING.md | `src/adapters/semantic_abi.mjs`, `src/core/subject.mjs`; declared bounded slices and methods applied | Exact conversion/feed-consumption relations remain reusable domain specifications. The merged Apache grant is scoped to Pavlo additions; Federico/babyblueviper1 guard code retains separate attribution/terms. |\n \n-## All 23 external and shared repositories\n+## v0.1 accounted 23 external and shared repositories\n \n-| Repository | Mode | Audit snapshot | Fresh default | Current default grant | Concrete product files / status | Account |\n+| Repository | Mode | Audit snapshot | v0.1 observed default | v0.1 observed grant | Concrete product files / status | Account |\n | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n | akashmahlaz/betting-club | no_useful_capability_found | `f85d3ea4e1a6e9ada21d576380c104a0b32976a1` | `f85d3ea4e1a6e9ada21d576380c104a0b32976a1` | ABSENT_NO_ROOT_GRANT | No capability implementation selected; accounted source not implemented | Bounded issue-only relevance/license/source-tree triage found no implementation, executable finding or receipt adapter useful to this product. The contact is retained in the complete scope inventory, not converted into code contribution credit. |\n | babyblueviper1/semantic-execution-guard | historical | `093dc4f7832c1e18ede0bf9de6fb590aad6fbea8` | `093dc4f7832c1e18ede0bf9de6fb590aad6fbea8` | ABSENT_NO_ROOT_GRANT | No capability implementation selected; accounted source not implemented | This dependency source is retained for original guard authorship/provenance. Its absent root grant is not cured by a later grant for another author's additions. |\n@@ -94,3 +94,73 @@ The Moth integration copies 50 unchanged, independently pinned source/metadata f\n The normalized `integrationMode` enum in every source record is DEPENDENCY, PINNED_SOURCE, REIMPLEMENTED_FROM_SPEC, TEST_FIXTURE or METHODOLOGY_ONLY. Rich role/status and `used` remain separate. Working original Interpoll action/retry, PQ provider/vector/temporal-authority interfaces and local conduct reproduction are bounded slices. Kit, RSI and SEG assurance methods are applied explicitly; complete native scan/runner/oracle/Robinhood/Solidity execution is not claimed.\n \n The original saved full product suite records 251/251 with zero failures, cancellations or skips; the original saved corpus records 30/30 and original saved mutation report records fourteen kills. `provenance/sources.json` preserves the exact report digests with historical scope. The prior concurrent cleanup-control failure also remains preserved. Current corrected-candidate counts and release decisions are in the [release-candidate audit](RELEASE_AUDIT_v0.1.md).\n+\n+## v0.2 additive source use across all 43 historical repositories\n+\n+The tables above retain the v0.1 audited source accounts and observed pins. They\n+are not relabeled as new default-branch observations. The public v0.1.0 base is\n+`62cd3e59c8f568496ed087d55f0aec3d63363b0a`. The machine catalog preserves every\n+historical row and all 74 original source records while adding eight source\n+integration records across six repositories. The generic v0.2 core composes\n+existing Crystal integrity and RVR replay with the new compatibility boundary.\n+No upstream repository is modified.\n+\n+The following table accounts for every original audit repository again. A\n+retained baseline role does not invent new v0.2 source execution or sole\n+Pavlo authorship. Older work is not excluded by age. Existing optional,\n+methodology, historical and no-transferred-capability conclusions remain\n+explicitly retained where no new v0.2 integration is selected.\n+\n+| Repository | v0.2 contribution and exact new source selection | Modes / maturity | Boundary |\n+| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n+| akashmahlaz/betting-club | v0.1 no_useful_capability_found account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Bounded issue-only relevance/license/source-tree triage found no implementation, executable finding or receipt adapter useful to this product. The contact is retained in the complete scope inventory, not converted into code contribution credit. |\n+| babyblueviper1/semantic-execution-guard | v0.1 historical account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | This dependency source is retained for original guard authorship/provenance. Its absent root grant is not cured by a later grant for another author's additions. |\n+| casinocutup/Solana-Mines-Game | v0.1 no_useful_capability_found account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Bounded issue-only relevance/license/source-tree triage found no implementation, executable finding or receipt adapter useful to this product. The contact is retained in the complete scope inventory, not converted into code contribution credit. |\n+| CYPHES-ATP/Artifact-Two | v0.1 optional_interface account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | ATP bundle and negative-control contracts remain optional. The atpprotocol core verifier and Pavlo tools/specification are distinct contributions; all-SKIP is not coverage. |\n+| CYPHES-ATP/Stealth | v0.1 optional_interface account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Portable evidence/root/Merkle source remains an optional profile reference. Root equality does not authenticate real coding execution; the whole desktop is not selected. |\n+| eddieoz/bitBingo | v0.1 no_useful_capability_found account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Bounded issue-only relevance/license/source-tree triage found no implementation, executable finding or receipt adapter useful to this product. The contact is retained in the complete scope inventory, not converted into code contribution credit. |\n+| ethereum/ERCs | v0.1 optional_interface account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Open ERC-8404 PR1980 is a pinned normative proposal, not accepted default behavior. Other ERC authors retain upstream attribution. |\n+| Interpoll1/decentralised | interpoll-native-signed-action-v02 @ `559e47f2cd2ffcbd8ad38293da89448d8ec3152d`; interpoll-exact-retry-trace-v02 @ `559e47f2cd2ffcbd8ad38293da89448d8ec3152d` | PINNED_SOURCE / EXPERIMENTAL; REIMPLEMENTED_FROM_SPEC / EXPERIMENTAL | Native signed-action verifier executes; exact retry/supplied-observation composition is original. No application, SQL, deployment or actual server execution provenance is established. |\n+| jdleo/provably-fair-dice | v0.1 no_useful_capability_found account retained; no additional source integration selected for v0.2 | Retained v0.1 account; no new maturity claim | Bounded issue-only relevance/license/source-tree triage found no implementation, executable finding or receipt adapter useful to this product. The contact is retained in the complete scope inventory, not converted into code contribution credit. |\n+| justFiveDev/Solana-